    "area": "ch9",
    "domain": "Domain III",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "question": "*Scenario.* A model posts 99.1% test accuracy; the auditor finds thousands of test records are near-duplicates of training records from the same customers. The evaluation defect is:",
